# Atlas Core - Component Token Architecture & Edge-Case Specification
**Author:** Jax Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 09:10  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Design token architecture defining interactive component states for Atlas Core across SaaS and Face-to-Face kiosk touchpoints, mapped against compliance metrics established in Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
